<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Credito Italiano upgrade.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Credito Italiano upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs upgraded Italian banking group Credito Italiano to &quot;market outperformer&quot;, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reason for the change in rating was given as the bank's attractive risk/reward ratio.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
